5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I think we need a more structured system. The current arrangement is too vague, and it's becoming unreliable for those of us who need the car for a consistent daily routine.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"I totally agree, Misaki. It's becoming a bit of a headache, isn't it? We need something that doesn't feel like a second job just to figure out who owes what. Let's get organized!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to seek order when harmony fades. To ensure no one carries a hidden burden, we must look at the true costs. I suggest we examine last year's fuel receipts and the tax, insurance, and parking papers.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I agree we need a system, but it's not just about the money. We're all getting grumpy with each other. I want to know why these things usually fall apart. Let's check what other car-sharing households said.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with you guys! It's kind of a mess right now, isn't it? I want to know exactly how much we're spending and who's actually driving. Let's get some real numbers so we can be fair!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"Numbers are important, but the daily experience matters more. I'm often finding the car missing or messy when I need it most. We should look into the hours of use recorded in the diary and the state of the car at handover.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I feel you on the mess! But honestly, the worst part is the endless chatting and calculating every single time. I want to see the hours of use in the diary and those repeating weekly trips.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is true that the spirit of the journey is as important as the destination. However, to find lasting peace, we must first understand the patterns of our habits. I agree that the diary is essential.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, patterns are fine, but if we only look at numbers, we'll still be fighting. I'm also going to look into the spell of checking each other's figures to see if that's where the tension starts.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, that's a good point! But I still think we need the hard facts first. I'm going to check last year's fuel receipts and the tax, insurance, and parking papers to see the total cost.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree that we need a balance. While costs are a factor, the reliability of the car on a weekday morning is what affects my life most. I'll stick with the handover state and the diary.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I'm with you on the reliability, but let's not forget the mental drain! I'm definitely sticking with the diary and the repeating weekly trips to see where our time is actually going.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"True fairness is a mirror that reflects the truth of our contributions. To avoid any quiet subsidies, I shall look into last year's fuel receipts and the tax, insurance, and parking papers.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm sticking with what other car-sharing households said and the spell of checking each other's figures. We need to fix the vibe of the group, not just the math, or we'll just fight again.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm still leaning towards the numbers! I'll go with last year's fuel receipts and the tax, insurance, and parking papers. Let's see what the actual damage is so we can start fresh!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,It seems we have a good variety of perspectives. I'll focus on the state of the car at handover and the hours of use recorded in the diary to address the practical issues.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,Sounds like a plan! I'll stick with the hours of use recorded in the diary and the trips that repeat weekly. Let's hope this saves us from all those endless coordination headaches!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us proceed with an open heart. I will examine the fuel receipts and the tax, insurance, and parking papers. Understanding the financial foundation is the first step toward a truly equitable and harmonious arrangement for us all.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm set. I'll look into what other car-sharing households said and the spell of checking each other's figures. Let's make sure we don't just fix the money and keep the bad mood.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm all set too! I'll dive into the fuel receipts and the tax, insurance, and parking papers. I can't wait to see the real figures so we can finally stop guessing!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
